{
  "version": 2,
  "comment": "发布能力注册表 — 15 平台发布提交内容项单一真源（openspec/changes/publish-capability-registry）。数据由 CJS（publish-capabilities.js，主进程/Node）与 ESM（publish-capabilities.browser.js，渲染进程）双版本共同消费，禁止在两侧复制本文件内容。通用内容判定阈值：语义能力 ≥3 平台 → common；=2 → semiCommon；=1 → unique（用户 2026-10-08 确认）。status 语义：implemented = 本仓代码当前真实消费该字段；platform-capable = 平台 API 支持但本仓未暴露（证据：参考产品 4.13.19 逆向 bundle（本机逆向工程目录的 packages/main/dist/index.cjs，目录名含品牌词按 Gate 12 红线不入库，可复现定位法寻回），2026-10-08 提取证）。标签文案沿用 PLATFORM_NAMES 先例存放于共享数据层（apps/desktop/src 的 CI CJK 基线扫描不覆盖本目录）。",
  "platforms": {
    "wechat_mp": { "titleMode": "title", "limits": { "titleMax": 64, "contentMax": 20000 } },
    "zhihu": { "titleMode": "title", "limits": { "titleMax": 50, "contentMax": 100000 } },
    "weibo": { "titleMode": "caption", "limits": { "titleMax": 0, "contentMax": 10000 } },
    "douyin": { "titleMode": "title", "limits": { "titleMax": 55, "contentMax": 5000 } },
    "xiaohongshu": { "titleMode": "title", "limits": { "titleMax": 20, "contentMax": 5000 } },
    "tencent_video": { "titleMode": "caption", "limits": { "titleMax": 0, "contentMax": 5000 } },
    "kuaishou": { "titleMode": "caption", "limits": { "titleMax": 0, "contentMax": 480 } },
    "toutiao": { "titleMode": "title", "limits": { "titleMax": 30, "contentMax": 100000 } },
    "bilibili": { "titleMode": "title", "limits": { "titleMax": 80, "contentMax": 2000 } },
    "baijiahao": { "titleMode": "title", "limits": { "titleMaxBytes": 149, "contentMax": 100000 } },
    "youtube": { "titleMode": "title", "limits": { "titleMax": 100, "contentMax": 5000 } },
    "tiktok": { "titleMode": "caption", "limits": { "titleMax": 0, "contentMax": 2200 } },
    "twitter": { "titleMode": "caption", "limits": { "titleMax": 0, "contentMax": 280 } },
    "instagram": { "titleMode": "caption", "limits": { "titleMax": 0, "contentMax": 2200 } },
    "facebook": { "titleMode": "title", "limits": { "titleMax": 100, "contentMax": 63206 } }
  },
  "commonFormFields": [
    {
      "key": "title",
      "semantic": "title",
      "label": "标题",
      "platforms": ["wechat_mp", "zhihu", "weibo", "douyin", "xiaohongshu", "tencent_video", "kuaishou", "toutiao", "bilibili", "baijiahao", "youtube", "tiktok", "twitter", "instagram", "facebook"],
      "noTitleBehavior": "caption-first-line",
      "note": "无标题平台（titleMode=caption）标题合并入描述首行；有标题平台独立填写"
    },
    {
      "key": "content",
      "semantic": "content",
      "label": "正文/描述",
      "platforms": ["wechat_mp", "zhihu", "weibo", "douyin", "xiaohongshu", "tencent_video", "kuaishou", "toutiao", "bilibili", "baijiahao", "youtube", "tiktok", "twitter", "instagram", "facebook"]
    },
    {
      "key": "tags",
      "semantic": "tags",
      "label": "标签",
      "platforms": ["wechat_mp", "zhihu", "weibo", "douyin", "xiaohongshu", "tencent_video", "kuaishou", "toutiao", "bilibili", "baijiahao", "facebook"],
      "note": "标签风格由引擎 content-formatter TAG_STYLES 分平台转换（#tag / #tag# / plain）"
    },
    {
      "key": "topics",
      "semantic": "topics",
      "label": "话题",
      "platforms": ["zhihu", "weibo", "kuaishou", "bilibili"]
    },
    {
      "key": "mentions",
      "semantic": "mentions",
      "label": "提及(@)",
      "platforms": ["weibo", "twitter", "instagram", "facebook"]
    },
    {
      "key": "cover",
      "semantic": "cover",
      "label": "封面",
      "platforms": ["wechat_mp", "zhihu", "douyin", "xiaohongshu", "tencent_video", "kuaishou", "toutiao", "bilibili", "baijiahao", "youtube"],
      "note": "视频号封面由视频抽帧，无独立封面上传链；抖音另有横版封面（platform-capable）"
    },
    {
      "key": "video",
      "semantic": "video",
      "label": "视频文件",
      "platforms": ["weibo", "douyin", "xiaohongshu", "tencent_video", "kuaishou", "baijiahao", "youtube", "tiktok", "bilibili", "twitter", "instagram", "facebook"]
    },
    {
      "key": "images",
      "semantic": "images",
      "label": "图片",
      "platforms": ["wechat_mp", "zhihu", "weibo", "xiaohongshu", "toutiao", "twitter", "instagram", "facebook"],
      "note": "微博单帖图片上限 18 张（参考产品取证：images.slice(0,18)）"
    },
    {
      "key": "schedule",
      "semantic": "schedule",
      "label": "定时发布",
      "platforms": ["wechat_mp", "zhihu", "weibo", "douyin", "xiaohongshu", "tencent_video", "kuaishou", "toutiao", "bilibili", "baijiahao", "youtube", "tiktok", "twitter", "instagram", "facebook"],
      "note": "**平台侧定时**（2026-10-07 架构变更）：创建定时任务时把排期提交给平台，由**平台服务器到点发布**，应用关着也能发。逐平台能力（api 直连接参 / rpa 页面定时选项 / 不支持）以 platform-schedule-capability.js 为唯一真源；⚠️ 不支持平台侧定时的平台在创建阶段即被显式阻断，绝不静默立即发布（参考产品 4.0 的 7 个不支持平台正是「守卫不成立就跳过赋值 ⇒ 内容立即发布」的静默失败形态，本仓明令禁止）。⚠️ 本列表的含义是「这些平台的发布链路接入了定时字段」，**不代表当前全部支持** —— 当前仅 toutiao 完成真机取证，其余平台需逐个取证后在该注册表启用。平台清单 ≠ 能力清单，二者不可混用。"
    },
    {
      "key": "aiGenerated",
      "semantic": "ai-declaration",
      "label": "AI 生成内容声明",
      "platforms": ["kuaishou", "bilibili", "baijiahao"],
      "note": "DOM RPA ai_declaration 选择器覆盖三平台；恰好满足 3 平台通用阈值"
    }
  ],
